This project runs third-party tools as separate processes. They are not linked
into the gateway binary and keep their own licenses:

  rtl_433        GPL-2.0-or-later   https://github.com/merbanan/rtl_433
  rtldavis       GPL-3.0            https://github.com/lheijst/rtldavis (optional module, not in v1)
  librtlsdr      GPL-2.0            https://github.com/osmocom/rtl-sdr

Release images and update bundles that include a build of any GPL tool ship the
corresponding source, or a written offer for it, as that license requires. The
release workflow attaches the exact source archive and build recipe to each
GitHub Release.
